    "research": "USMaterialsPilot free Q4 2026 sample reconstructed at publication using company evidence available by October 31, 2026. The latest retained company source is dated October 29. This is a 25-company subset with 18 positive targets, not the deployed pilot or a contemporaneous October portfolio. XE is unscored because confirmed board independence is missing from the retained pre-cutoff primary sources; the IPO prospectus states expectations, not completed determinations. EOSE and OKLO remain unscored watchlist names. The original universe and provisional method were selected after the cutoff; retrospective application does not establish a point-in-time strategy record. The evaluation discloses scores and neutral defaults. REPORT.md documents inputs, cutoff changes, evidence and limitations. The fixed 28-name network scope remains, while the initial percentile and one-sleeve weights are recalculated over these 25 names. Account data and $100 prices in the fixture are fictional and separate from research. This signed demo supports reading and offline previews only and cannot place paper orders. No investment advice or performance results are provided.",
